<section class="slide" id="io"><div class="content">
  <div class="kicker">09 / INPUT-OUTPUT CALCULATION</div><h2>投入产出法：加工产品抵扣计算</h2>
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>产品</th><th>销售数量</th><th>单耗</th><th>核定耗用数量</th><th>平均购买单价</th><th>扣除率</th><th>允许抵扣额</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
